00:53:13,078 --> 00:53:14,078
I must analyse it,

912
00:53:14,098 --> 00:53:19,078
I must overcome it, resist it, and so on.

913
00:53:19,078 --> 00:53:24,078
So you are strengthening fear.

914
00:53:26,078 --> 00:53:33,078
So can you look, can the mind look at fear

915
00:53:35,078 --> 00:53:36,078
– which we are going

916
00:53:36,078 --> 00:53:37,078
to a little bit more –

917
00:53:37,078 --> 00:53:39,078
without the centre?

918
00:53:39,078 --> 00:53:43,078
Can you look at that fear without naming it?

919
00:53:45,078 --> 00:53:48,578
Because the moment you say fear,

920
00:53:48,578 --> 00:53:52,078
it is already in the past,

921
00:53:52,078 --> 00:53:55,078
because you have named it.

922
00:53:56,078 --> 00:53:59,078
You are following all this?

923
00:54:02,078 --> 00:54:05,078
Because the moment you name something,

924
00:54:05,078 --> 00:54:08,078
don't you divide it?

925
00:54:09,078 --> 00:54:11,078
The white and the black

926
00:54:11,078 --> 00:54:13,078
and the brown and the communist,

927
00:54:13,078 --> 00:54:15,078
don't you?

928
00:54:21,078 --> 00:54:24,078
And so that very division

929
00:54:24,078 --> 00:54:28,078
is a form of resistance,

930
00:54:30,078 --> 00:54:32,078
conflict and fear.

931
00:54:33,078 --> 00:54:37,078
So the question is to observe

932
00:54:37,078 --> 00:54:41,078
without that centre,

933
00:54:43,078 --> 00:54:45,078
and not to name the

934
00:54:45,078 --> 00:54:47,078
thing called fear as it arises.

935
00:54:49,078 --> 00:54:53,078
All this requires tremendous discipline.

936
00:54:58,078 --> 00:55:01,078
You know, the word discipline means to learn,

937
00:55:01,078 --> 00:55:08,078
to learn from somebody.

938
00:55:13,078 --> 00:55:15,078
You are not learning from the speaker,

939
00:55:15,078 --> 00:55:18,078
you are learning from yourself.

940
00:55:18,078 --> 00:55:24,078
And to observe all this very closely,

941
00:55:26,078 --> 00:55:27,078
with care,

942
00:55:27,078 --> 00:55:32,078
which means with affection and attention,

943
00:55:34,078 --> 00:55:38,078
then the mind is looking without the division

944
00:55:38,078 --> 00:55:44,078
as a centre to which it has been accustomed to.

945
00:55:46,078 --> 00:55:48,078
Therefore there is an ending of fear,

946
00:55:50,078 --> 00:55:53,078
both the hidden and the open.

947
00:55:57,078 --> 00:56:00,078
If you haven't done it this evening,

948
00:56:00,078 --> 00:56:03,078
don't take it home and think about it.

949
00:56:08,078 --> 00:56:12,078
Truth is something that you must say immediately.

950
00:56:18,078 --> 00:56:22,078
And to say something clearly and immediately,

951
00:56:22,078 --> 00:56:24,078
you must give your heart and your mind

952
00:56:24,078 --> 00:56:26,078
and your whole being.

953
00:56:27,078 --> 00:56:28,078
That's all.

954
00:56:28,078 --> 00:56:29,078
Thank you.

